      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Canada Immigration Levels Plan 2027–2029: What to Expect Now That It Is Released
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-4">
        The federal 2027–2029 Levels Plan is out. It holds permanent residence at 380,000 a year, raises the PNP target to 95,000, keeps new temporary arrivals at 370,000 and adds a one-time 2027 measure for up to 200,000 people already in Canada. This guide sets out the published numbers, what changed from the previous plan, and what BC PNP candidates should watch next.
      </p>
